    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kuwa U Soo Noqdaa Rabbiga Way Barakoobaan",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 30:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo markii waxyaalahan oo dhammu ay idinku dhacaan, kuwaas oo ah barakada iyo inkaarta aan idin hor dhigay, oo aad ku xusuusataan quruumaha Rabbiga Ilaahiinna ahu uu idinku kexeeyey dhexdooda oo dhan, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 30:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "oo aad Rabbiga Ilaahiinna ah u soo noqotaan oo aad idinka iyo carruurtiinnuba qalbigiinna oo dhan iyo naftiinna oo dhan ku addeecdaan codkiisa iyo waxyaalahan aan maanta idinku amrayo oo dhan, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 30:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "markaasaa Rabbiga Ilaahiinna ahu idinka celin doonaa maxaabiisnimadiinna, wuuna idiin naxariisan doonaa, oo mar kaluu idinka soo ururin doonaa quruumihii Rabbiga Ilaahiinna ahu uu dhexdooda idinku kala firdhiyey oo dhan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 30:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo haddii masaafirradiinna qaarkoodu joogaan meesha samada ugu shishaysa, Rabbiga Ilaahiinna ahu halkaasuu idinka soo ururin doonaa, oo halkaasuu idinka soo kaxayn doonaa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 30:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "markaasaa Rabbiga Ilaahiinna ahu wuxuu idin keeni doonaa dalkii awowayaashiin mar hore hantiyeen, oo idinna waad hantiyi doontaan, oo wanaag buu idiin samayn doonaa, wuuna idinka sii badin doonaa intii awowayaashiin ahaan jireen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 30:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo markaas Rabbiga Ilaahiinna ahu sida jidhka loo gudo ayuu idinka jari doonaa xumaanta qalbigiinna iyo tan qalbiga farcankiinna inaad Rabbiga Ilaahiinna ah ka jeclaataan qalbiga oo dhan iyo nafta oo dhan si aad u noolaataan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 30:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo Rabbiga Ilaahiinna ahu inkaarahan oo dhan wuxuu ku ridi doonaa cadaawayaashiinna iyo kuwa idin neceb oo idin silcin jiray. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 30:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo idinna waa inaad soo noqotaan, oo aad addeecdaan codka Rabbiga, oo aad yeeshaan amarradiisa aan maanta idinku amrayo oo dhan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 30:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo Rabbiga Ilaahiinna ahu wuxuu idinku barwaaqayn doonaa shuqulka aad gacanta ku qabataan oo dhan iyo midhaha jidhkiinna iyo midhaha xoolahiinna, iyo midhaha dhulkiinnaba, waayo, Rabbigu mar kaluu ku farxi doonaa inuu wanaag idiin sameeyo siduu awowayaashiin ugu farxay oo kale, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 30:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "haddaad addeecdaan codka Rabbiga Ilaahiinna ah oo aad xajisaan amarradiisa iyo qaynuunnadiisa ku qoran kitaabkan sharciga, iyo haddaad Rabbiga Ilaahiinna ah ugu soo noqotaan qalbiga oo dhan iyo nafta oo dhan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kaladoorashadii Nolol Iyo Geeri",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 30:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 30:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waayo, amarkan aan maanta idinku amrayo ma aha mid aad idiinku adag, mana aha mid idinka fog.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 30:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 30:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo samadana kuma uu jiro si aad u tidhaahdaan, Bal yaa samada noo kori doona oo noo keeni doona, oo na maqashiin doona aannu amarkaas yeelnee? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 30:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo baddana kama uu shisheeyo si aad u tidhaahdaan, Bal yaa badda nooga gudbi doona oo noo keeni doona, oo na maqashiin doona, aannu amarkaas yeelnee? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 30:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Laakiinse eraygii waa idiin dhow yahay, wuxuuna ku jiraa afkiinna iyo qalbigiinna inaad yeeshaan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 30:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 30:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bal eega, maanta waxaan idin hor dhigay nolol iyo wanaag, iyo geeri iyo shar, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 30:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "oo waxaan maanta idinku amrayaa inaad Rabbiga Ilaahiinna ah jeclaataan, oo aad jidadkiisa ku socotaan, oo aad wada xajisaan amarradiisa iyo qaynuunnadiisa iyo xukummadiisa inaad noolaataan oo badataan iyo in Rabbiga Ilaahiinna ahu idinku barakeeyo dalka aad ugu socotaan inaad hantidaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 30:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Laakiinse haddii qalbigiinnu sii jeesto, oo aad dhegaysan weydaan, laakiinse laydiin jiito inaad ilaahyo kale caabuddaan oo u adeegtaan, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 30:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "waxaan maanta idiin caddaynayaa inaad hubaal halligmaysaan, oo cimrigiinnu ku dheeraan maayo dalka aad Webi Urdun uga gudbaysaan inaad gashaan oo aad hantidaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 30:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maanta waxaan u yeedhayaa samada iyo dhulka inay idiinku markhaati furaan, inaan idin hor dhigay nolol iyo geeri, iyo barako iyo inkaar, haddaba sidaas daraaddeed nolosha doorta idinka iyo farcankiinnuba aad noolaateene, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 30:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "idinkoo Rabbiga Ilaahiinna ah jecel, oo codkiisa addeecaya, oo isaga sii xajista, waayo, isagu waa noloshiinna iyo dhererka cimrigiinna inaad degganaataan dalkii Rabbigu ugu dhaartay inuu siinayo awowayaashiin oo ahaa Ibraahim, iyo Isxaaq, iyo Yacquub.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
